@startuml ASignX_System_Architecture
title ASignX - Current system architecture
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526581
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #AFC5ED
skinparam cloudBorderColor #AFC5ED
skinparam ranksep 45

actor "People\nGuest, learner, administrator" as Users
rectangle "Web browser\nReact + Vite\n\nASignLive, ASign Learn, admin workspace\nCamera JPEG capture and text composition\nSign Strike simulated-input demo" as Web
rectangle "Application API\nNode.js + Express + TypeScript\n\nIdentity, role and ownership checks\nLearning, imports, hearts and XP transactions\nPrivate recognition gateway\nPostgres.js + Drizzle schema" as API
rectangle "Private recognition service\nPython + FastAPI\n\nMediaPipe hand landmarks\nStatic / sequence ONNX inference\nStabilized labels and confidence\nSymSpell word / sentence assistance" as Recognition
artifact "Local private assets\nserver/private/models\nONNX models, metadata, hand_landmarker.task" as Models
cloud "Supabase" {
 rectangle "Auth\nAccounts and access tokens" as Auth
 database "PostgreSQL\n23 application tables\nRLS, constraints and grading triggers" as DB
 rectangle "Storage\nPrivate learning-media bucket\nCurated sign MP4 demonstrations" as Storage
}
Users --> Web : Use application
Web --> API : /api requests and responses\nJWT for protected routes
API <--> Recognition : Private HTTP + X-Recognition-Key\nJPEG frames, NLP input and results
Recognition --> Models : Read local assets
API --> DB : Transactional SQL
Web --> Auth : Registration, confirmation, sign-in\nand session refresh
API --> Auth : Verify protected-request access tokens
Web --> Storage : Signed video playback\nAdmin uploads under Storage policies
Auth ..> DB : Managed auth.users\nand confirmed-profile trigger
API -[hidden]down-> Recognition
Recognition -[hidden]down-> Models
Auth -[hidden]down-> DB
DB -[hidden]down-> Storage
legend bottom
 Current source review: 5 November 2026.
 Camera frames are processed in memory; lesson grades and XP persist in PostgreSQL.
 ASignLive text stays in browser memory. Curated videos persist in Storage.
 Local development: browser 5173 -> Express 3000 -> private service 8001.
endlegend
@enduml
